the rite "litanies" is converted to pattern "Mark II"; its scripture of pattern "Mark I" is kept at /librarium/rites/.mark-i/litanies.json; changed in meaning, as the comments of its scripture tell: the litany of verse 1 is spoken as enact words, the litany of verse 2 is spoken as enact words, the reversion of verse 2 is struck, the auspex of the rite is struck
